==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[home]] [[run]]}}

# {{senseid|en|(baseball) four-base hit}}{{context|baseball|lang=en}} A four-base [[hit]], a [[homer]]
#: ''The first baseman hit a '''home run''' to lead off the ninth.''
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} The portion of a journey that ends at home
#: ''I'm on the '''home run'''.
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} A [[success]]; especially, a popular success.
#: ''The product was a '''home run'''.''
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} [[sexual intercourse|Sexual intercourse]].

